Subject: [PATCH 03/19] Persistent gear for sim bodies; removing a companion
 from the party dismisses them

- sim_agent.kit / kit_due: a body wears the kit it had last time; levels gained mark pieces due, the weakest due pieces are rerolled at the next spawn; anything equipped on a sim body is recorded
- GroupHandler: kicking a sim companion = dismiss

